      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even feel like a person anymore. lately everything just feels... thin. like i'm staring at the world through a layer of static and i can't remember what it felt like to actually be \"me.\" it's like my memories and my personality are just evaporating. i'm becoming a stranger to my own mind and it's terrifying.",
