    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just burnout though. it feels more fundamental than that. like the \"me\" part of me is just... dissolving. if there's no real person left inside here to actually experience anything, what's the point of even trying to fight it? it feels like i'm just watching a movie of a life that isn't mine anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
